<div class="sc-support-page"><header class="sc-support-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Here to help</p><h1>Help and support</h1><p>Tell us what went wrong, or find the next step. Your requests and replies stay together in StockChief.</p></div><div class="sc-support-contact"><strong>support@stockchiefhq.com</strong><span>We reply by email. Support conversations are answered by a person.</span><a class="btn" href="/support#support-request">Write a request</a></div></header>
<div class="sc-help-links"><a class="card" href="/guide"><h2>Find your way</h2><p>Step-by-step help for everyday work.</p><span>Open the guide →</span></a><a class="card" href="/settings/connections"><h2>Check a connection</h2><p>See its status, updates and any setup needed.</p><span>Open Connections →</span></a><a class="card" href="/activity"><h2>See what happened</h2><p>Find an order, stock change or recent action.</p><span>Open activity →</span></a></div>
<% if(locals.supportAccess?.isOperator){ %><section class="card card-body sc-support-operator"><div><h2>Your customer support desk</h2><p>Manage customer conversations and your live availability.</p></div><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/commercial-admin/support">Open your Support desk</a></section><% } %>
<div class="sc-support-columns"><div id="support-request"><% if(locals.supportRequestKey){ %><%- include('partials/support-form') %><% } %></div><aside><section class="card card-body"><h2>A useful report includes</h2><ul><li>What you were trying to do.</li><li>What happened and what you expected.</li><li>The order, product or connection reference.</li></ul><p>Leave out passwords, API keys and card details.</p></section><% if(locals.supportAccess){const a=supportAccess.agreement; %><section class="card card-body"><h2><%= supportAccess.chat?'Priority support conversations':supportAccess.priority?'Priority email support':'Email support' %></h2><p>Open a request below and continue the conversation here. You can also reply to support@stockchiefhq.com.</p><% if(a){ %><h3><%= a.status==='ACTIVE'?'Your agreed services':'Service agreement for your review' %></h3><p style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= a.service_text %></p><% if(a.manager_name){ %><p>Account manager: <%= a.manager_name %> · <%= a.manager_email %></p><% } %><% if(a.response_hours){ %><p>First-response target: <%= a.response_hours %> elapsed hours after a new request.</p><% } %><% if(a.status==='PREPARED'&&a.owner_account_id===account.id){ %><form method="post" action="/support/agreement/accept"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= a.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I accept these exact service terms.</label><button class="btn" type="submit">Accept service agreement</button></form><% } %><% } %></section><% } %>

</aside></div></div>